{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "建议父母亲自带孩子并多拥抱", "content": "建议父母在孩子出生时不要为了方便把孩子交给别人抱或照顾，除了喂奶外不要把所有时间都交给别人。孩子没有记忆但有感受，身体接触的气味、拥抱方式、体温都不同。父母应记住拥抱孩子，自己带孩子，即使累也要自己抱孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["亲自带孩子", "拥抱", "依恋关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-da99cc4d78d6-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-da99cc4d78d6", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-da99cc4d78d6-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-da99cc4d78d6-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "父母亲自带孩子并多拥抱", "reason": "a006建议父母亲自带孩子并多拥抱，a004说明身体接触建立依恋关系，前者是后者的实践建议。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-da99cc4d78d6-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
